      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 875a7423e7f893476ea02833b00f589c3c75afdc\nparent 2063f02bd5edebe1b5c9635db8850220811ebc90\nauthor Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1783139759 -0700\ncommitter Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1783305767 -0700\n\nvalidation: avoid preallocating txsdata when checks are skipped\n\nDuring IBD and reindex, `ConnectBlock()` skips script verification for blocks in the `assumevalid` period, but still performs one heap allocation for a fresh `txsdata` vector and default-constructs one `PrecomputedTransactionData` entry for every transaction in each connected block.\nBecause `CheckInputScripts()` is not called in that path, that work is unused and only adds allocator churn and avoidable heap fragmentation on large blocks.\n\nLeave `txsdata` empty unless `fScriptChecks` is true, then resize it before queued checks can take pointers into the vector.\nKeep `txsdata` declared before `control` so queued script checks finish before the storage is destroyed.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCAAdFiEEqXy8dDLWkKQdUrTAZp//D/pHenYFAmpLFicACgkQZp//D/pH\nenag7Q/9GP4ddeY9ssAAClyIo4eP6QArY4BDecgO6O3qVdWRj4Gx7Z8pObw8RxtN\nXLadBjl/ONNsreao0grFn/kiRFNDE3U4zubJ1J3gwim9bo1zeOCI0XJIGr7jzHu4\nvrgNxOxCcvgnRh7tTTYkkF/C0XlaIokxFWUoIghnRWBfXzhT4Fw/VbyhtYT1Gcz7\nZzvxcORjQ7aTvqb/17WkK++H+j/8qb9fJ8duL9D3EF1z3r4JkDMZLrnDPzKjaGAQ\nHpPsO1MfeAWI043OzbFFngu+mOr5mi14OFtqf0vlfAK7o/Nv6WooXBJ//ukyC/FH\nAvRQeLWdCUa+eRVpIdggOGexrwcPJTaBEi+UJ/8Zj0GLofsdC7IBDwUGk8NM90QC\nt0f6n5AkGNCylG4KApkNxpL6PowciCMXkHne5TOTicwh1BWv/4RmwymtSpN9srOU\nfElLfIZh5ihfT5k6BXy3W6YPgEauh5vJqxnmqnxFLDgXlr0rUI+7Ll3IlBg5maJa\npQz2RaeeLuptH65QPM6gRjTrybzivQmIRXTkAYnnc2JaIGRjqJ4hHPNfsk3H+bza\nWkUv3eZ76TwG21hllMa6tccKFuW2DvHa8MnzykTSi0fboupXc5gYa3TFMOJ59Y71\nA/IhnwoJhRZJh+kijsycXlJTP+Wf5tOYamCOuqTxDP1sbb29IRo=\n=KSu/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
